<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>:first-child and :last-child</title>
<style>
 body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 40px; }
 ul { width: 280px; padding: 15px 15px 15px 40px; background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid #ccc; }
 li { margin: 6px 0; font-size: 18px; }
 li:first-child { color: #fff; background: #1976d2; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px; list-style: none; }
 li:last-child { color: #fff; background: #d32f2f; font-style: italic; padding: 6px; list-style: none; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
 <h2>Programming Languages</h2>
 <ul>
 <li>Java</li>
 <li>Python</li>
 <li>C++</li>
 <li>JavaScript</li>
 <li>PHP</li>
 </ul>
</body>
</html>
